    "note": "Modelo 303 (VAT) is filed and paid from the 1st to the 20th of April, July and October, and until 30 January for the fourth quarter. The modelo 130 income-tax prepayments share those dates. The annual Renta return is paid by 30 June of the next year, so the income-tax reserve stays until then.",
